461	
462	  // SFCC-271-250 pass criterion 3: at quantity 1 (this file's own default mock), decrement is
463	  // disabled — resolves the audit's own found discrepancy (the old, real picker floored at 0,
464	  // never speced or tested against any AC; ZimmQuantityStepper's own tested floor, since step
465	  // 3.1, is 1).
466	  test('quantity 1: decrement is disabled', () => {
