472	  // "Also verify" (plan step 3.5 — not a numbered pass criterion, but flagged as the step's own
473	  // highest-scrutiny requirement): proves handleStepperQuantityChange (product-item/index.tsx)
474	  // still calls the REAL basket mutation (onItemQuantityChange) with the correct next quantity on
475	  // both increment and decrement, and only commits that value to local state (setQuantity) when
476	  // the mutation resolves truthy — mirroring product-quantity-picker.tsx's own pre-existing
477	  // handleQuantityChange contract exactly, just adapted to the new callback shape (a
478	  // already-computed next value, not a raw input-change event to parse).
479	  describe('handleStepperQuantityChange — real-mutation-then-conditional-local-update', () => {
480	    test('increment: calls onItemQuantityChange with quantity + 1, and commits it locally when the mutation resolves true', async () => {
481	      mockUseDerivedProduct.mockReturnValue({
